          "why-1",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "how-3"
        ]
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "A series of generator failures since May revealed the urgent need for system modernization, culminating in a massive 950-megawatt capacity loss. As the archipelago was placed on red alert, the rising risk of rotating blackouts is now pushing exploration into distributed grid solutions to avert future crises.",
